rify PRM_Pending__c field exists). </li><li>BusinessLicense: License records linked to the Case Manager (developer must verify PRM_Pending__c field exists). </li><li><span>PersonEducation: Education records linked to the Case Manager (developer must verify PRM_Pending__c field exists).</span> </li> </ul> </div>																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																							
