1362818	Requirement	RCAT - Practitioner Statuses & Termination Date Scenarios - Future Dated			UAT	Active	Bentley, Charles (CW) <Charles.Bentley@ibx.com>		IHG	BX; Go Live; NR; rcat; UAT	488294226	7803	IHG\BTS EIM\PNM\Sprint 52	9561	IHG\BTS EIM\Provider Network Management		<div>1. From <a href="https://1901market.visualstudio.com/IHG/_workitems/edit/1347482/" data-vss-mention="version:1.0">#1347482</a>&nbsp; RCAT --&gt;<span style="background-color:rgb(255, 192, 128);"> Screen 1, Screen 2 or Screen 3/Recred Updates</span> &amp; <span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 128);">Future Date</span><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 128);">d</span><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 128);">, the following futured dated logic is accounted for:</span> </div><div><span style="color:rgb(12, 100, 192);">Dev Note: Per </span><a href="https://1901market.visualstudio.com/IHG/_workitems/edit/1338593/" data-vss-mention="version:1.0"><span style="color:rgb(12, 100, 192);">#1338593</span></a><span style="color:rgb(12, 100, 192);">&nbsp;if Practitioner is also Delegated/PNC --&gt; Full-Termination process as Non-Participating Termination (should behave the same as below until&nbsp;</span> </div><div><ul><ul><ul><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"> </ul> </ul> </ul> </ul><li>If Termination is future dated --&gt;&nbsp; Scheduled Job is created to update the following fields on Termination Date </li><ul><li><span style="color:rgb(12, 100, 192);">​Example Scenario:</span><br> </li><ul><li><span style="color:rgb(12, 100, 192);">Today is 12/17/2025</span> </li><li><span style="color:rgb(12, 100, 192);">Termination Date is 12/31/2025</span> </li><li><span style="color:rgb(12, 100, 192);">Evaluation above calculates based for Termination Date -- On 12/31/2025, Practitioner will or will not have Active PPLTN where Network Class = Plan Based?</span> </li><ul><li><span style="color:rgb(12, 100, 192);">If Yes --&gt; Fields are updated on 12/31/2025</span> </li><ul><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Participating Code = &quot;Participating&quot; </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Non-Participating Start Date = {Null} </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Credentialing Status = {Null} </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Delegated Only = </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">TRUE if ALL Practitioner's Practice Location remaining have Active Info Code with Type = Delegated </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Else, FALSE </li> </ul> </ul><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">PNC Only =&nbsp; </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">TRUE if ALL Practitioner's Accounts remaining have PNC = TRUE </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Else, FALSE </li> </ul> </ul> </ul><li><span style="color:rgb(12, 100, 192);">If No --&gt; Fields are updated on 12/31/2025</span> </li><ul><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Participating Code = &quot;Non-Participating&quot; </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Non-Participating Start Date = {Termination Date} </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Credentialing Status = &quot;Terminated&quot; </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Delegated Only = </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">TRUE if ALL Practitioner's Practice Location remaining have Active Info Code with Type = Delegated </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Else, FALSE </li> </ul> </ul><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">PNC Only =&nbsp; </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">TRUE if ALL Practitioner's Accounts remaining have PNC = TRUE </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Else, FALSE </li> </ul> </ul><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"> </ul> </ul> </ul><li><span style="color:rgb(12, 100, 192);">Between today - 12/31/2025, Practitioner remains Credentialed &amp; Participating&nbsp;</span> </li> </ul> </ul> </ul> </ul><div><font><br></font> </div><div><font><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></font> </div><div><span>​RCAT Termination Date Scenarios:</span><br> </div><div><span><br></span> </div><div><span>2.&nbsp;<span style="display:inline !important;">For RCAT &amp; Recred Updates Termination --&gt; The following date logic is considered when updating Effective To Dates:</span><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Effective To is blank --&gt; Update Effective To to Termination Date (Normal Scenario) </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">If Effective From &gt;= Termination Date --&gt; Error Records <span style="color:rgb(12, 100, 192);"><b>(Note: Applies to Account with PNC and Delegated not checked)</b></span> </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Effective From = TODAY </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Is Error = TRUE </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Active = FALSE </li> </ul><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Effective To is prior to Termination Date --&gt; Leave existing Effective To (no updates) </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Ex:&nbsp; </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Effective From = 1/1/2025&nbsp; </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Effective To = 12/1/2025 </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Submitting Termination Date of = 1/1/2026 </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;"><b style="box-sizing:border-box;">Effective To should remain 12/1/2025</b> </li> </ul> </ul> </ul><li style="box-sizing:border-box;"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;">Effective To is after Termination Date --&gt; Update Effective To to Termination Date</span> </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Ex:&nbsp; </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Effective From = 1/1/2025 </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Effective To = 2/1/2026 </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;">Submitting Termination Date of = 1/1/2026 </li><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;"><b style="box-sizing:border-box;">Effective To should be updated to 1/1/2026</b> </li> </ul> </ul> </ul> </ul></span> </div> </div><div><div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;"><div><div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline !important;"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;"><div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;"><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"> </ul> </div> </div> </div></span> </div></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																							
